<title>USA: Sioux City hogs $1.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs $1.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were mostly $1.00 lower. Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     60.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     57.00-58.00</p>
<p>Sows:    300-500 lbs steady to 1.00 lower; 500-700 lbs steady to</p>
<p>1.00 higher. Top 49.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs     46.50</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs     47.50-48.00</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs     49.00-49.50</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs     49.50</p>
</text>
